nCopyright © 강원경기수학회\n\n김병문 ^{1} ,  황운재 ^{2} ,  송병철 ^{3}\n\n^{1}강릉원주대학교\n\n^{2}고려대학교\n\n^{3}강릉원주대학교\n\n\n140 회 열람\n\n현재 페이지 인쇄 PDF 다운로드 인용보기\n\n공유\n\n### 초록\n\nAn L(3,2,1)-labeling for the graph G=(V,E) is an assignment f of a label to each vertices of G such that |f(u)−f(v)|≥4−k when dist(u,v)=k≤3. The L(3,2,1)-labeling number, denoted by λ3,2,1(G), for G is the smallest number N such that there is an L(3,2,1)-labeling for G with span N. In this paper, we compute the L(3,2,1)-labeling number λ3,2,1(G) when G is a cylindrical grid, which is the cartesian product Pm◻Cn of the path and the cycle, when m≥4 and n≥138. Especially when n is a multiple of 4, or m=4 and n is a multiple of 6, then we have λ3,2,1(G)=11. Pro-cess. Lett. / 113 : 361 ~\n  * 7. [학술지] G. J. Chang / 1996 / The L(2; 1)-labeling problem on graphs / SIAM J Dis-crete Math / 9 : 309 ~\n  * 8. [학술지] M. L. Chia / 2011 / L(3; 2; 1) labeling of graphs / Taiwan. J. Math / 15 : 2439 ~\n  * 9. [학술지] J. R. Griggs / 1992 / Labeling graphs with a condition at distance two / SIAM J. Discrete Math / 5 : 586 ~\n  * 10. [학술지] W. K. Hale / 1980 / Frequency assignment: theory and application / Proc. IEEE / 68 : 1497 ~\n  * 11. [학술지] B. M. Kim / 2015 / L(3; 2; 1)-labeling for the product of a complete graph and a cycle / Taiwan. J. Math. / 19 : 819 ~\n  * 12. [학술지] B. M. Kim / 2013 / Distance three labelings for direct products of three complete graphs / Taiwan. J. Math / 17 : 207 ~\n  * 13. [학술지] B. M. Kim / 2013 / Distance three labellings for Kn × K2 / Int. J. Comput. Math. / 90 (5) : 906 ~ 5\n  * 14. [학술지] J. Liu / 2004 / The L(3; 2; 1)-labeling problem on graphs / Math. Appl / 17 : 596 ~\n  * 15. [학술지] Z. Shao / 2013 / Integer linear programming model and satis ability test reduction for distance constrained labellings of graphs: the case of L(3; 2; 1) la-belling for products of paths and cycles / IET Commun / 7 : 715 ~\n  * 16. [학술지] Z. Shao / 2015 / L(3,2,1) -labeling of triangular and toroidal grids / Cent. Eur.